 Search","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/ai-search/content-security-ais.md","line":67},{"title":"Dynamic Translation","target":"dynamic-translation","line":79},{"title":"Add a system property","target":"t_AddAPropertyUsingSysPropsList","line":100},{"title":"Genius Results","target":"genius-results-ais","line":102},{"title":"Dynamic Translation for Now Assist Q&amp;A Genius Results","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/ai-search/dynamic-translation-na-gr.md","line":102},{"title":"Search signal tables","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/search-administration/search-signal-tables.md","line":108},{"title":"Pin cached answers for Now Assist Q&amp;A Genius Results","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/ai-search/caching-now-assist-q-a-gr.md","line":109},{"title":"Now Assist Q&amp;A Genius Results","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/ai-search/now-assist-qna-genius-results.md","line":111},{"title":"Install Now Assist in AI Search","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/ai-search/install-now-assist-ais.md","line":119},{"title":"Now Assist in AI Search","target":"now-assist-ais","line":119},{"title":"Caching for Now Assist Q&amp;A Genius Results","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/ai-search/caching-now-assist-q-a-gr.md","line":129},{"title":"Add a system property","target":"t_AddAPropertyUsingSysPropsList","line":158},{"title":"AI Search","target":"ia-ai-search","line":159},{"title":"Now Assist Q&amp;A Genius Results","target":"now-assist-qna-genius-results","line":160},{"title":"Results","target":"hs-results","line":161},{"title":"Dynamic translation","target":"dynamic-translation","line":162},{"title":"Genius Results","target":"genius-results-ais","line":163},{"title":"Now Assist in AI Search","target":"now-assist-ais","line":164}],"metadata":{"title":"Caching for Now Assist Q&amp;A Genius Results","description":"AI Search provides two query-time caches to improve search performance for Now Assist Q&amp;A Genius Results. Caching enables AI Search to return previously generated Now Assist Q&amp;A Genius Result answers without submitting knowledge articles to the Now LLM Service for answer generation.Improve performance for Now Assist Q&amp;A Genius Results by pinning frequently used answers in the second-level cache. Pinning an answer exempts it from the cache's purge mechanism.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/platform-administration/ai-search/caching-now-assist-q-a-gr.html","release":"australia","product":"AI Search","classification":"ai-search","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":9,"keywords":["Now Assist","AI Agents","generative AI","agentic AI","Now Assist","AI Agents","generative AI","agentic AI"],"breadcrumb":["Now Assist Q&amp;A Genius Results","Configuring Now Assist in AI Search","Now Assist in AI Search","ServiceNow Store applications and integrations","AI Search","Search administration","Configure core features","Administer the ServiceNow AI Platform"],"tags":["#platform-administration","#ai-search","#indexing","#relevancy","#search","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/platform-administration/ai-search/caching-now-assist-q-a-gr.md"},
